<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12947" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόκρῐμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>judicial sentence, condemnation</i> ( 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάκριμα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ. τοῦ θανάτου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
					1.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> (from 
				Med.
			) <i>answer,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοῦναί τισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					12.26b
				</span></i>
			.<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>; esp. of the <i>answers</i> given by Emperors to
				<i>legationes,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἐπὶ τῶν Ἑλληνικῶν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					804.5
				</span></i>
			 (Cos, <span class="entity">i A. D.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τῶν ἐπιστολῶν καὶ πρεσβειῶν καὶ
					ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Suid.
				</span></i>
			
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διονύσιος</span>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(1).2.4
			</span></i> (Rhodes, <span class="entity">i A. D.</span>, pl.), <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				14.10.6
			</span></i>; also of a proconsul of Asia, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				494.18
			</span></i> (Milet., <span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>rescript,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοῦ Ἁδριανοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					286.1
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>.</div>
